    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/81b64fd66da44ab56b7910e407d03b49.avif?t=1696516738\" /></div><br><br><strong>Get ready for adventure!</strong><br><br>Take control of Wukong and start your journey to places full of challenges that you will have to overcome with the help of your staff and skills. Explore every corner to find the lost scrolls and conquer the challenges that appear along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/d8683d59b42d6a6a9ccb4c1597e7f3cb.poster.avif?t=1696516738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/d8683d59b42d6a6a9ccb4c1597e7f3cb.webm?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/d8683d59b42d6a6a9ccb4c1597e7f3cb.mp4?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wukong is an action platform game, in which you will learn new ways to use your staff in order to get to the end of the adventure.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 levels full of challenges and platforms to beat.<br></li><li>Jump, spin, throw your staff, and step on those that get in your way.<br></li><li>Explore the levels and find all the treasures.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/af6b267836d272ad784070189f7765c1.poster.avif?t=1696516738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/af6b267836d272ad784070189f7765c1.webm?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/af6b267836d272ad784070189f7765c1.mp4?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/81b64fd66da44ab56b7910e407d03b49.avif?t=1696516738\" /></div><br><br><strong>Get ready for adventure!</strong><br><br>Take control of Wukong and start your journey to places full of challenges that you will have to overcome with the help of your staff and skills. Explore every corner to find the lost scrolls and conquer the challenges that appear along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/d8683d59b42d6a6a9ccb4c1597e7f3cb.poster.avif?t=1696516738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/d8683d59b42d6a6a9ccb4c1597e7f3cb.webm?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/d8683d59b42d6a6a9ccb4c1597e7f3cb.mp4?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wukong is an action platform game, in which you will learn new ways to use your staff in order to get to the end of the adventure.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 levels full of challenges and platforms to beat.<br></li><li>Jump, spin, throw your staff, and step on those that get in your way.<br></li><li>Explore the levels and find all the treasures.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/af6b267836d272ad784070189f7765c1.poster.avif?t=1696516738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/af6b267836d272ad784070189f7765c1.webm?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910310/extras/af6b267836d272ad784070189f7765c1.mp4?t=1696516738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
